{
 "method": {
  "before": "WebGL build size of mines-leader in gzip -9 (MB = 10^6).\n\nUsage: measure.py <build dir> <out stats.json> [--section before/addressables] [--meta key=value ...]\nEngine: Build/*.br unpacked with `brotli -d`, re-packed with python gzip level 9 (mtime 0); loader.js gzip -9 as is.\n.data entries are parsed (UnityWebData1.0) and each entry is gzipped separately.\nAddressables content: StreamingAssets/aa/**: bundles as is (LZ4 in the bundle) = served now (nginx gzip off),\ngzip9 = gzip -9 on top of the LZ4 bundle. Service files: catalog.bin, settings.json, AddressablesLink/link.xml (link.xml is in the build total but not downloaded by the player, so not in stages); catalog.hash -> content.other, not counted.\nBuilt-in bundles (monoscripts, unitybuiltinassets) are counted in the menu stage.\n\"served\" of totals/stages = engine in gzip9 + content as served now (LZ4 bundles and service files without transfer compression).\nStages (cumulative, engine included): menu, match - by the group lists below (ScopeExtensions + StartupAssetsPreload).",
  "after": "WebGL build size of mines-leader with engine content bundles (framework 0.9.0), gzip -9 (MB = 10^6).\n\nUsage: measure_content.py <after build dir> <before build dir> <stats.json> [--meta key=value ...]\nWrites the section `after` of stats.json (keeps `before`) and `after.comparison` (before vs after, gzip9 and prod).\nEngine: Build/*.br unpacked with `brotli -d`, re-packed with python gzip level 9 (mtime 0); loader.js gzip -9 as is.\n.data entries (UnityWebData1.0) gzipped separately; preloaded bundles = entries /vfs_streamingassets/Content/*.bundle.\nCatalog: Resources/Content/catalog.json inside data.unity3d (UnityFS, LZ4HC blocks, own unpacker).\nContent: StreamingAssets/Content/*.bundle.gz as is (gzip9 = served), *.bundle (Music) as is.\nprod = as served by nginx (gzip off): engine .br as is, loader.js raw; before: aa bundles LZ4 as is + catalog.bin + settings.json;\nafter: .gz and Music as is.\nStages (cumulative, engine included): menu = GamePlayViews + Menu + SharedMenu with dependencies (Main, SharedCommon in .data),\nwith and without Music (Music is requested after start, the menu does not wait for it); match = menu + GamePlay."
 },
